<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETURU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Peturu dyo Muthsidi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peturu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dyo Muthsidi dya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peturu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Yame no Simoni Peturu, ngamba no kanganda ka Yesu Krisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Naa ñorera awa na piwa thsitawo thsothsikuru mu thsivaka thso kucipitura nethsi thsetu kowawa wa Nyambi no Muyoyithsi wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Thsihemo no thsiyaro ikare nenu kongi ko ku dimuka Nyambi no Yesu Fumu wetu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwithsiwa no kuhanguriwa ko Makrisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Kokoro onyambi wenthzi, Nyambi naa tu pa enu yoihe eyi i na fotahara mu mwoyo o thsitawo ko ku mu dimuka, aye oyu naa twithsera mu kutethzima no muwa wenthzi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Mweyo, Nyambi na a tu pa ekumbwethzo yoikuru mu thsivaka karo yoikuru, ci tu twethse ku ciera ku mukarero onyambi, no ku thsevuka yokwipa yo mu kaye eyi i retiwa kecikumbwethza yo thsivi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Mukaci keyi, mu kwame momuhe omu mu na twethsera ci ku thsitawo thsenu mu vungithseko owa, karo kuwa mu vungithseko odimukero. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Kudimukero mu vungithseko kucinyunga, ku kucinyunga mu vungithseko othzui, kuthzui mu vungithseko mwoyo o thsitawo. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Ku mwoyo o thsitawo mu vungithseko ku cishima naenthzenu, karo ku ku cishima naenthzenu mu vungithseko thsishimo ku munu yomuhe. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Inene ngeci amwepo mwikara neyi enu kongi, kenge ya ku mi retera ci mwa vapa nji ku kana kwima ima mu ku dimuka kwenu Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Uno honi yomuhe o kupira eyi enu, wa ku monena po pepi, karo kapuputwa, o na vurama ci naa kenithsiwa kwivi yenthzi yo kare.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Mweyo, aenthzange, mu kwame momuhe omu muna twethsera ku tanarithsa kwithsiwa no kuhanguriwa kwenu, inene ngeci amwepo mu tenda kengeyo, mbera ka mu u. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Karo kenge mwa ku tamburiwa ko direma ou mwa kwingena mu Kutumina ko diyere kwa Fumu no Muyoyithsi wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Mweyo, kenge ni mi vurukithsanga eyi enu thsikati thsothsihe, shaanga ci na mu i dimuka kare, karo muna tanara nene mushemwa ou mu di nao pano. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Naa mona ci kwaa roera ku mi vurukithsanga eyi enu uno ni yoya mweyino erama. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Inene ni na dimuka ci ni tamba ku thsia eyi erama, eci edi a ni tongwerire Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Karo kenge na ku kwama momuhe omu ni na twethsera ci munyima thzo kufa kwange, mwa ku twethse ku vurukanga eyi enu thsikati thsothsihe.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambangi awa monine kutethzima kwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Inene ka twa shupwerire matangu o ku kwamiwa konyanyami ou twa mi tongwerire yo kukeya kokoro kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu, unone twa u cimonenine ko meho etu o ku di mu kutethzima kofumu wenthzi. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Inene ou a tamburire kwa Nyambi Tata direma no kutethzima, kwa yuvaharire diywi edi dya tundire mu Kutethzima Koshokuru, edi dya ambire ci: “Oyu po Mwanange oyu na shima, aye oyu na ni roerithsanga nene.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Twa ciyuverire twathsinda edyo diywi dya tundererire ku wiru o ku tu di nenthzi pa mukinya o shokenu.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Karo tu di no diywi dyokethzi edi tu na kurupera nene, kenge nga mu tenda nawa ou nga mu di twarera maano, inene yaa cipitura eci kambarambara aka ka muneka mu ndau thzo mirema shime ku ka kuma ruura, karo Krisitu aye Dirungwe ayepo va mu micima thzenu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Thso kutanga, mwaa roera ku dimuka ci kwithsa okethzi mu Mañoro ou wa keyire ko kuyuvithsithsa kwa mukwakukethza thsinda. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Inene okethzi ka wa keyire keshima yo munu, unone anu a ambire ku tunderera kwa Nyambi ko ku tangereriwa ku Mupepo Oukenu.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Arongithsi o mbango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Unone ku kare nako kwa keyangire akwakukethza o mbango, eci dyodi kwa ku keya arongithsi o mbango mu kaci kenu. Kenge a ku retamo muvudi erongithsa yo kwipa yo kwipithsa, kuninga ci mane kenge a ku hamura Ñathsire wo oyu na a wa uru, ku ciretera athsinda kunongithsiwa ko wanguwangu. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Owangi kenge a ku shupwera ongurunde wo, mukaci kowa arongithsi, dikuñwa dyoshemwa kenge dya kwipithsiwa dithzina. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mukaci ko rununa rwo, awa arongithsi o mbango kenge a ku mi pukura ko maywi onyanyami. Unone Nyambi naa wa ratura kare, karo kunongithsiwa kwo ka ku rarire.<figure style="fig" alt="Noah's Ark" file="co00630b.tif" size="col" loc="2 Pet 2:4-5" copy="Cook" ref="2.4-5">Areka thza Nuwe</figure><verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Inene Nyambi ka andwire tungeru otu twa tendire thsivi, unone wa tu konthzerire mu dihere no ku twanga ko madyenge o mirema thzothzikuru, mo twa kwikara shime ku kuma mu diyuwa dyo raturo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Karo Nyambi ka andwire kaye ko kare ou a retire dimina kwanu owamango, unone wa ungurire pohuma Nuwe mukwakuhonga owawa namweya o mutanu naidi. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Karo Nyambi shime a raturire mambongi a Sodoma na Gomora ko ku a ñotokithsa ko mudiro, ku monithsa akwakukana ku tawa muro keyi ya ku tendahara kukwo. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Karo shime a amwenine pohuma Lota mukwerume o muwawa oyu wa cinyengangire mukaci kongurunde wanu a shiremeka murao. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Oyu munu o muwawa, wa yoyire diyuwa no diyuwa mu kaciko, wa korangire nene ku mucima wenthzi ouwa ou a monangire no ku yuva etenda yo yoimango. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Shaanga apa idi kengeyo, Fumu aye na dimuka dyo ku amwena anuenthzi kwiereka, no ku turekera anu o dipethso humbithso shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa dyo raturo. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Eyi po ya shemwa, nenepo kwanu awa a na shupwera ecikumbwethza yoimango yerama, no ku yengwera okoro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Kokeshu no maranduru, awa arongithsi ka yapire ku shwahura akwakutethzima o ku wiru. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Unone shaanga tungeru, otu tu di nokoro nene o ku piterera, ka tu raturangire ko matuka awo o kutethzima pa meho a Fumu.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Unone awa anu aa cipitura eci eyama yo kupira maano, eyi yerekiwerire ku kwatiwa no ku paiwa. A epithsa dithzina enu eyi a na kana ku yuvithsithsa. Nawo kenge a kunongithsiwa eci eyama. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Kunyandithsiwa odiyo muyambo wo mwikwama yo yoimango. Aa cikoranga ku tenda yoimango mutenya wa marumba. Aa fithsa honyi no ku reta ku shwahuriwa mu kaci kenu, karo aa cikora kwangera o kwa dya nenu. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Meho o a na yara mirembe, kadi akwa ku thsia ku tenda thsivi. Aa hongawera mu thsivi awa na kana ku tanara. Micima thzo na thzi cirongithsa rununa. Na kutiwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Na tundu mu dikuñwa dyo ku oroka no ku shupwera dikuñwa edi a endire Balaami Mwana Beori, oyu wa shimine nene madi aa a wanine pa ku tenda omango. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Unone wa kutururiwire mukaci kekwama yenthzi yoimango. Shaanga ci thsindongi thsa diyerire thsi amba, thsa ambire ko diywi dyo munu ku kanithsa oyo mukwakukethza ci a tenda yothzaruki wenthzi.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Awa anu aa cipitura eci manowa o kupira meyu, karo aa cipitura eci mbundwi ethzi thzi endithsiwa ku dyungu. Awopo a na turekeriwa mirema thzothzikuru. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Inene akwamununa, karo a amba enu yotomba. Kongurunde wecikumbwethza yerama, aa hongaura awa a para kowa a yoya mu dikuñwa dyo kwipa. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Aa kumbwethza anu ci kenge a kurukuruka, unone awa amba kengeyo po apika yokwipa. Inene munu yomuhe aa pikuriwa ku thsinu thsothsihe ethsi thsi na mu othzo. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Inene ngeci anu awa na para kumango o kaye ko ku dimuka Fumu no Muyoyithsi wetu Yesu Krisitu, awopo a hukera mumango no ku othziwa, awo anu o kengeyo mukarero wo o ku mamaneneno kenge wa kwipa nene kupita pa kutanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Nga yekarire nawa ci nga a diyerire ku dimuka dikuñwa dyowawa, kupita ku tanga ku di dimuka no ku pa muongo thsiraerera thsothsikenu ethsi na piwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Eyi a amba aa maambo o shemwa na i tendahara ku kwo, o ku amba ci: “Mbwa na hukera oshanje wenthzi,” karo dimweya dyaa amba ci: “Nguru oyu na yoiwa marowa na hukera ku cirowekamo.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="rem">ML, MN, TC, CC, Trt</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikumbwethzo thso kukeya kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ashimiwa ange, edi diñoro ni na mi ñorera pano dyodiyo dyo muthsidi. Momu widi wao shime na ni ereka ku pindura eanekera yenu yoshemwa keyi na ni mi vurukithsa. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Naa fota ci mu vuruke maywi aa a ambire akwakukethza owakenu ku kare no thsiraerera ethsi thsa tundire kwa Fumu no Muyoyithsi wetu ko ku cikwathsithsa tunganda twenu.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Thso kutanga mu dimuke ci mu mayuwa o mahurerero kenge kwa ku keya akwamushepuruthzi, awa a ku shepurura oshemwa no ku shupwera ecikumbwethza yo yo thsivi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Kenge a ku amba ci: “Kuma a kumbwethzire ci kenge a ku ka huka, kupi a di? Akwathsañuruetu a fa kare unone enu yoihe shimbi yekarera dyodi yekarire ku tatekera apa kombiwerire kaye.”<verse eid="2PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Awa anu aa civuramithsa pohuma ñenya ci ko ku tumina ko diywi dyenthzi, ku kare Nyambi wombire diwiru, karo kaye ka tundererire mu meyu no ku ka thzingurukithsa meyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Karo koa meyu, kaye ko kare kepithsiwire ku dimina dyodikuru. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Unone kedyo diywi, diwiru dyo rerodino no kaye ko rerodino yaa turekiwera mudiro, yaa turekiwera diyuwa dyo raturo no kunongithsiwa kwanu o kukana ku tawa.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Unone ashimiwa ange, mwa vurama ci kwa Fumu diyuwa dyofoci dyaa cipitura eci myaka thzo kakore kofoci (1,000), karo myaka thzo kakore kofoci (1,000) thzaa cipitura eci diyuwa dyofoci. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Fumu ka a katapithsire eyi a kumbwethzire, eci edi a anekera amweya ci aa katapa. Unone aa mi tenda ko ku kwata mucima, inene ka a fotire ci ku nonge shaanga munu yofoci. Aye aa fota ci anu wahe a cere. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Diyuwa dya Fumu kenge dya ku keya eci mwithzi. Mwedyo diyuwa diwiru kenge dya ku pwa ko muvumo oukuru o ku yapithsa, o ku pitura eci mushika o mvura. Yo ku wiru yoihe kenge ya ku ñotoka ku mudiro, kaye neyi i dimo yoihe kenge ya kwipa.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Pakuninga ci enu yoihe kenge ya kwipithsiwa kenge ne, mwaa roera kwikara anu o ngepi? Mwaa roera ku yoya mwoyo oukenu no mwoyo o thsitawo, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />uno mu taterera diyuwa dya Nyambi no ku yokororithsa kukeya kwadyo. Inene mwedyo diyuwa diwiru kenge dya ku tumekiwa, enu yo mu wiru kenge ya ku nyongoroka ku kupya. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Unone kokuthza ko thsikumbwethzo thsenthzi, twaa taterera diwiru dyodipe no kaye kokape, omu kwa tunga owawa.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Mweyo, ashimiwa ange, pakuninga ci mwaa taterera eyi ci i tendahare, mu kwame momuhe omu mu na twethsera ci a ku na mi wane o ku mu di o kupira katamwethzi nji thso ku mi shomorora pa meho a Nyambi, karo o ku mu yoya ko thsiyaro.<verse eid="2PE 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mu dimuke ci kukwatamucima kwa Fumu wetu po kuyoyithsiwa, eci dyodi a mi ñorerire mushimiwa wetu muenthzetu Paulu naye kokuthza ko mathsaano aa a mu pire Nyambi. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Aa ñoranga kengeyo mu mañoro enthzi oahe aa a na ñoranga. Mu mañoro enthzi mo i di enu imweya yoikaru ku i yuvithsithsa, eyi a na tengururanga anu awa a na kana ku dimuka thsimweya nowa a na kana ku tanara mu thsitawo, eci dyodi a na tendanga ku Mañoro amweya. Anu awa tenda kengeyo po aa cithsera athsinda kunongithsiwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi a Peturu o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Mweyo, amwe ashimiwa ange, pakuninga ci na mu nomenithsiwa cimo, mu mamere ci mwa ku yembururiwa ku kumbunja kwanu a shiremeka murao no ku yawa kutanara kwenu. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Unone mu kure mu thsihemo no mudimukero wa Fumu no Muyoyithsi wetu Yesu Krisitu. Ku kwenthzi kwikare kutethzima thsino thsikati no diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>